{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rama's Quest</strong> is an action survival game where you equip unique weapons and get divine powers from the gods to help you face endless demons in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become Rama, the legendary archer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield your bow against challenging swarms of demons that haunt the Dandaka Forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/basic_fight.gif?t=1728936231\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Invoke Divine Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet Vishnu, Arjuna, Krishna, and more legendary gods from Hindu mythology. Perfect your builds by invoking their boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/gods_boon.gif?t=1728936231\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight unique enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The forest contains Rakshasa with various attack styles, like sword slashing, ground slamming, spear throwing, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/boss_summon.gif?t=1728936231\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Face Powerful Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through powerful Rakshasa bosses to win</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/final_boss.gif?t=1728936231\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join the community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Discord to keep up with updates and new releases from Roadtrip Games.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2786990?t=1728936231","